{"id":"6228082765353868","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-substitution.md","title":"df-substitution","display":"df-substitution","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","depends_on":["[[56-df-terms]]","[[56-df-variables]]"],"label":"56-df-substitution","aliases":["56-df-substitution"],"display":"df-substitution","type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"491e726b9c1f42b0\" href=\"?note=491e726b9c1f42b0\" title=\"56-df-variables\">56-df-variables</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substitution"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-substitution\"><code>df-substitution</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a>；项变量集见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"491e726b9c1f42b0\" href=\"?note=491e726b9c1f42b0\" title=\"56-df-variables\">56-df-variables</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathcal V\\to T\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathcal V\\to T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathcal V\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathcal V\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq T^{\\mathcal V}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq T^{\\mathcal V}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subst}(\\sigma)\\iff\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Subst}(\\sigma)\\iff\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dom}(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathcal V\\mid\\sigma(x)\\ne x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Dom}(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathcal V\\mid\\sigma(x)\\ne x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\mid|\\operatorname{Dom}(\\sigma)|&lt;\\aleph_0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\mid|\\operatorname{Dom}(\\sigma)|&lt;\\aleph_0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}_{A}\\coloneqq\n\\{(x,\\sigma(x))\\mid x\\in A\\}\\cup\\{(x,x)\\mid x\\in\\mathcal V\\setminus A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}_{A}\\coloneqq\n\\{(x,\\sigma(x))\\mid x\\in A\\}\\cup\\{(x,x)\\mid x\\in\\mathcal V\\setminus A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Renaming}(\\sigma)\\iff\n\\sigma[\\mathcal V]\\subseteq\\mathcal V\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in\\mathcal V\\;(\\sigma(x)=\\sigma(y)\\Rightarrow x=y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Renaming}(\\sigma)\\iff\n\\sigma[\\mathcal V]\\subseteq\\mathcal V\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in\\mathcal V\\;(\\sigma(x)=\\sigma(y)\\Rightarrow x=y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书明确不要求有限支持，因此一般替换集为全部 V→T 映射，有限支持另列为子集。Dom 依书中惯用语表示非恒等支持，不是真实函数定义域。带 upharpoonright 的操作在 A 外恢复恒等，仍为全替换。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>，定义2.1.13、记号2.1.14，印刷第31–32页，OCR页块52–53。本次据用户提供的本地 DjVu 文字层核对陈述；OCR页块序号不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-substitution","text":"`df-substitution`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-variables","status":"resolved","id":"491e726b9c1f42b0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-variables]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$\\mathcal V$ 与 $T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 如 [[56-df-terms]]；项变量集见 [[56-df-variables]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-variables","status":"resolved","id":"491e726b9c1f42b0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$\\mathcal V$ 与 $T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 如 [[56-df-terms]]；项变量集见 [[56-df-variables]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma:\\mathcal V\\to T","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq T^{\\mathcal V}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Subst}(\\sigma)\\iff\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dom}(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathcal V\\mid\\sigma(x)\\ne x\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\mid|\\operatorname{Dom}(\\sigma)|<\\aleph_0\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}_{A}\\coloneqq\n\\{(x,\\sigma(x))\\mid x\\in A\\}\\cup\\{(x,x)\\mid x\\in\\mathcal V\\setminus A\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Renaming}(\\sigma)\\iff\n\\sigma[\\mathcal V]\\subseteq\\mathcal V\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in\\mathcal V\\;(\\sigma(x)=\\sigma(y)\\Rightarrow x=y).","display":true}],"bytes":1655,"backlinks":[{"id":"94e07ab4a04b0626","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，$\\operatorname{Dom}(\\sigma)$ 见 [[56-df-substitution]]，后缀组合见 [[56-df-substitution-composition]]，$\\operatorname{Var}$ 见 [[56-df-variables]]。"},{"id":"2d69158e5cbd8317","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 ·